# AI Text Generation Chatbot

 Input: The user should enter one word while interacting with the chatbot and it gives a chat as response.
 output: Joke generated using user's input word.

Built using:
- Flowise
- LangChain
- Hugging Face Models
- LLM Chains

## Live Demo
https://cloud.flowiseai.com/chatbot/0e2f7f35-356d-49d1-aa08-595c6236ac72

## Features
- Text generation
- Prompt chaining
- LLM workflow orchestration
- Flowise visual builder
